IsyMotron avatar packs
======================

avatar/packs/malbolge-cat/
--------------------------

Copied from Companion (https://github.com/), repository
"C:\Development\ISyCo Git\Companion", directory `packs/malbolge-cat/`,
at source commit 0aae576 ("chore: ignore local worktrees").

Companion is the author's prior MIT-licensed work. The pack is copied, not
integrated: per the repo boundary rule, this copy is now IsyMotron's own
code. The manifest maps animation states to GIF files; the avatar renderer
consumes only those six states (idle, thinking, working, success, error,
waiting), which are exactly the values of the protocol's STATES set.

License: MIT (same as Companion). This file records the provenance; the
pack's own license terms travel with Companion's LICENSE.
